message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the information below."
title: "Neural Architecture and Extrapolation Uncertainty in Hybrid Hydrological Projections under Climate Change"
type: software
authors:
    given-names: Manamno Beza
    family-names: Dinku
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-26"
abstract: >
  Research code for evaluating neural architecture and extrapolation
  uncertainty in hybrid SWAT-deep learning streamflow projections
  under CMIP6 climate change scenarios. The framework evaluates
  LSTM, GRU, TCN, MLP, and LSTM-FCN architectures under SSP245
  and SSP585 climate scenarios.
